      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来自美国的留学生吉兆。\n她的目标是在日本竞赛界掀起革命，\n使其达到世界级水准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f84464ee408f3c79e259adae2e4e4270945d426f3c2e9e0d98846a98844940c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
