      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是她日本师父的梦想。\n而为了报答这位老师在年幼时指导自己的恩情，\n她打算实现这个梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fffdd4fcc9469fce92b7d6b0da307018bda109b2562110503ec972a76c4cecc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
