      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要达成目标必须展现超越常识的强悍。\n但她的身体不够强健，不能过于操劳。\n因此强化身体至关重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e9a180c2c97b65be0789e382ad1edf13f9bfa78f2bf685acc2046e1c86e7d10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
